Error [E2301]: this view points into `local`, which this function owns
  --> tests/ui/view_return_field_of_local.jet:7:18
    |
  7 |     return local.name;
    |                  ^^^^
 Why: `local` is made here and freed when the function returns, so a view into its fields would outlive what owns it — there'd be nothing left to look at
 Fix: return an owned copy (`.clone()` the field into an owned return type), or accept the source as a parameter so the caller keeps owning it
